<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
</head>
<body class="bg-paper text-ink font-body">
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-market px-4 sm:px-6 py-16 sm:py-20 border-b-4 border-ink">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.06] pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #fff 1.5px, transparent 1.5px); background-size: 22px 22px;"></div>
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto relative">
        <div class="max-w-2xl">
          <span class="inline-block bg-tag text-ink text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full mb-4 -rotate-2 border-2 border-ink">Sedia Setiap Hari</span>
          <h1 class="font-display font-black text-4xl sm:text-5xl text-paper leading-[1.05] mb-5">Belanja Sembako,<br />Tanpa Ribet Chat.</h1>
          <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-paper/85 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            Cek stok dan harga terbaru kapan saja langsung dari sini — tak perlu lagi menunggu balasan WhatsApp Ibu Aries satu per satu.
          </p>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a href="/produk" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-bold bg-spice text-paper border-2 border-ink hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform">Lihat Semua Produk</a>
            <a href="/tanya-ai" class="inline-block px-6 py-3 rounded-full font-bold bg-paper text-ink border-2 border-ink hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-transform">Tanya AI</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14">
      <div class="flex items-end justify-between mb-6 flex-wrap gap-2">
        <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl">Produk Pilihan</h2>
        <a href="/produk" class="text-sm font-semibold text-spice hover:underline">Lihat semua &rarr;</a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 pt-3">
        <% preview.forEach(function(p) { %>
          <%- include('partials/product-card', { p }) %>
        <% }); %>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 pb-16">
      <h2 class="font-display font-bold text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-6">Kenapa Belanja di Sini?</h2>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-5">
        <article class="flex-1 min-w-[220px] bg-market-light border-2 border-ink rounded-2xl p-5">
          <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">🏷️</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-1">Harga Transparan</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink/70">Semua harga tercantum jelas, tidak perlu tanya-tanya lagi lewat chat.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flex-1 min-w-[220px] bg-market-light border-2 border-ink rounded-2xl p-5">
          <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">📦</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-1">Stok Real-time</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink/70">Data stok selalu diperbarui langsung oleh pemilik toko.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="flex-1 min-w-[220px] bg-market-light border-2 border-ink rounded-2xl p-5">
          <span class="text-2xl" aria-hidden="true">💬</span>
          <h3 class="font-display font-semibold mt-2 mb-1">Tanya AI</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-ink/70">Punya pertanyaan umum? Fitur Tanya AI siap membantu kapan saja.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
